# The Stacks (Chapter 3): nested halls above the Reading Room, doors labelled like paths.
# Central hall (/stacks) from the south door. West: the scriptorium (3-05) and its vault
# (plate room A, chest). North-west: the old maps hall and the toll alcove (3-04, optional).
# East: the fire-damaged wing (3-06, braziers, a potion). North: the annex L (plate room B,
# carry the crate round the corner) opens on the flooded lower stacks (3-07), whose door
# climbs to the Census Hall. Solving 3-07 also opens the aqueduct gate down to the east wing.
